avourite story in this set, and my second favourite question, after Francis Bacon:", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:04Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "11.\nAt a quiz at Hindu College in mid-December 1974, X and his IIT Bombay teammate Nandan Nilekani were stumped by the question \"Who was the only British Prime Minister to have been assassinated?\" X took a wild guess and said Robert Peel. No team got it right. When the quizmaster threw the question open to the audience, a voice boomed from the back with the correct answer: \"Spencer Perceval, 1812.\" That voice belonged to Y, then a student at St. Stephen's College.\nDecades later, when Nilekani's company had an undersubscribed IPO, he asked X to invest Rs 10,000. X didn't, and has since called it \"the single biggest mistake of my life.\"\nBoth X and Y would eventually find themselves on the same side of the aisle in Parliament.\nID X (10) and Y (10).", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:17Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Jairam", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:18Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Tharoor", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:22Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Y?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:22Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Shashi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:23Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh wow", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-09T18:29:37Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Ye to kuch time pehle hi kisine link share Kara tha is gro